# Phase 2 — Detection Tool & Scoring Tool

## Summary
Implemented the Detection Tool (`DetectionTool`) and Scoring Tool (`ScoringTool`) for the AML suspicious activity detection architecture.
The Detection Tool integrates a pattern-specific heuristic rule engine, a PyOD unsupervised ML anomaly scorer (IForest + LOF with RobustScaler feature normalization), and an OR-gate ensemble combiner (ADR-3) with confidence metric calculations.
The Scoring Tool computes deterministic composite risk scores (0-100), classifies entities into `RiskLevel` bands (`LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`), assigns `EscalationAction` recommendations (`MONITOR`, `REVIEW`, `ESCALATE`), and persists `RiskAssessment` domain records into the DuckDB database.

